Package: newhallrs
Title: Fast Rust-Backed Newhall Soil Moisture and Temperature Regime Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrew Gene", "Brown", email = "brown.andrewg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Vectorized Newhall Simulation Model with classic jNSMR parity and
